Hello Salesforce User,

Salesforce is requiring an upgrade to it's security in order to align with industry best practices for security and data integrity. In order to continue working without any interruption, please take a 2 minute test to see if your browser is compliant with the latest requirements. 

Click on the link: https://tls1test.salesforce.com/s/

If you are able to view the above site without errors, access to Salesforce via your browser should not be impacted by this change, and no action is required.

If you see any errors, please get in touch with your IT support to upgrade your browser. 

If you have any Salesforce related questions, please email support@sevenpoints.co

Thanks,
Your Salesforce Support Team